        ":question/id": "0ad6f73f-5761-5c28-8db7-a8660f3425c7",
        ":question/problem": "$\\int -9{csc}^{2}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y=$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\int {csc}^{2}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y=-cot⁡y+C\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int -9{csc}^{2}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y & =-9\\int {csc}^{2}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-9(-cot⁡y)+C \\\\  & =9cot⁡y+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
