        ":question/id": "1e4160d5-83cc-561a-bbee-afcbf4a8b88b",
        ":question/problem": "Calculate $\\int csc⁡x(4cot⁡x+8csc⁡x)\\text{d}x.$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-cot⁡x+C, \\\\ \\int csc⁡xcot⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-csc⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int csc⁡x(4cot⁡x+8csc⁡x)\\text{d}x & =\\int (4csc⁡xcot⁡x+8{csc}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 4csc⁡xcot⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int 8{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4\\int csc⁡xcot⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+8\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4(-csc⁡x)+8(-cot⁡x)+C \\\\  & =-4csc⁡x-8cot⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
      "role": "independently authored inventory",
      "relationship_to_source_templates": "Distinct current generated inventory record sharing the direct-primitive templates; preserved exactly and excluded from MA source and difficulty evidence counts."
