        ":question/id": "b7364594-66f1-5b96-bf05-94cae90e6e0f",
        ":question/problem": "Calculate $\\int csc⁡x(2cot⁡x+1csc⁡x)\\text{d}x.$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-cot⁡x+C, \\\\ \\int csc⁡xcot⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-csc⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int csc⁡x(2cot⁡x+1csc⁡x)\\text{d}x & =\\int (2csc⁡xcot⁡x+1{csc}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 2csc⁡xcot⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int 1{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int csc⁡xcot⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+1\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2(-csc⁡x)+1(-cot⁡x)+C \\\\  & =-2csc⁡x-1cot⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
